{"unit_id":"ManoloRemiddi__dsh-adaptive-reasoning#card-zh","repo":"ManoloRemiddi/dsh-adaptive-reasoning","commit":"7c38ebb6b49f51c7d163fc278ef281ee7039b077","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Adaptive Reasoning（DSH 插件，Web 与桌面客户端）：按请求内容为指定模型路由自动选择推理强度，不调用额外分类模型。它通过 DSH 的请求与预步骤钩子，对问候、改写、翻译、摘要、普通分析及复杂任务分类，并映射到配置的 off、low、medium、high 推理档位。文本转换时可隐藏并阻止工具调用，续接或工具失败时恢复更高推理强度；还记录请求决策和响应计时，供报告脚本汇总。适合希望按任务调整模型推理成本与深度的 DSH 用户。需要配置预设和精确的 provider/model/effort 路由。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:91-110","src/policy.js:39-73"]}
{"unit_id":"ManoloRemiddi__dsh-adaptive-reasoning#card-en","repo":"ManoloRemiddi/dsh-adaptive-reasoning","commit":"7c38ebb6b49f51c7d163fc278ef281ee7039b077","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Adaptive Reasoning adjusts effort for configured model routes without extra classifier calls. It classifies greetings, edits, summaries, and complex tasks. Text edits can block tools; continuations and tool failures raise effort. It records timing for reports. Configure preset and model routes.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:91-110","src/policy.js:39-73"]}
